havior_or_material","lines":23115},"identity_resolved":true,"payload_role":"reference"},{"locator":{"path":"reference/pokemon-essentials/Data/Scripts/014_Pokemon/001_Pokemon-related/001_FormHandlers.rb","lines":[146,792],"unit":"Full registry inspected; SHELLOS has no creation/dynamic/onSet form registration; native new0 is unchanged before maternal0 submission"},"payload_identity":{"repository":"/Users/dingshinn/Desktop/pokemon-framework-reference/reference/pokemon-essentials","commit":"8c5911e4a4b07b07e832e4bb0d5d8859e88b4a9b","tree":"7589c800b61ba13a13040ed0d686979b80a84fd0","path":"Data/Scripts/014_Pokemon/001_Pokemon-related/001_FormHandlers.rb","bytes":23576,"sha256":"09697fb94d9e8565049cb45401cbb0bf7e610203068417bdc70741add590ae97","git_blob":"d643bcc5fc09d233880174bb2b7004c843d224ac","mode":"100644","type":"text","purpose":"reference_behavior_or_material","lines":792},"identity_resolved":true,"payload_role":"reference"}],"state_observation_and_later_result":{"before_maternal_submit":{"child_species":"SHELLOS","child_form":0,"child_steps_to_hatch":5120,"child_gender_cache":"unfilled","child_ordinary_shiny_cache":"unfilled","pokedex_seen_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_owned_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_seen_egg_SHELLOS":false},"parent_form":0,"immediate_after":{"child_form":0,"child_is_egg":true,"gender_and_ordinary_shiny_caches":"filled by registration","pokedex_seen_SHELLOS":true,"pokedex_seen_form":"registered actual gender/shiny with form0","pokedex_owned_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_seen_egg_SHELLOS":false},"no_submission_control":"Skip the form-inheritance call in an isolated conceptual comparison, no other registration path: form0 alone does not cause these writes. Not a normal alternate reference workflow claim."},"consumer":"EggGenerator1-255 fully read; complete Pokedex361 and corePokemon1227 previously/read freshly; actual default SHELLOS PBS record read; multipleForms792 fully read. R6-O independently supplied same setter binding at80/87, but K also independently read it.","definition_vs_wiring":"仅按本记录的具体前提与实际consumer定位；不由名称存在推默认接线。"}},"premises_and_counterexample":{"input_domain":["Fixed default SHELLOS base0 valid parents, female maternal species-parent0 and male appropriate parent; both nonShadow/nonEgg; all actual generation inputs valid.","Global player/Pokedex exists with SHELLOS unseen/unowned; clear initial seen-egg flag; region data and refresh dependencies valid; no plugin/hook mutation.","Basic child is created with stored form0 and positive hatch steps5120; SHELLOS lacks creation form function and egg-regional function; no earlier form registration.","Both owner languages same and no Shiny Charm for N0 contrast, so later shiny helper does not clear ordinary shiny cache.","Observe immediate maternal submission and optional completed generation, not real DayCare receptionist or native UI; later helpers normal."],"ordinary_control":"Current form value0 equals maternal value0, yet inheritance calls the unguarded committing setter. The numeric form remains0 while it recalculates and sends Dex registration. Pokedex register accepts egg and fills child gender/ordinary-shiny caches, seen/form/initial-last state, with owned and seen-egg remaining false. WP34(no operation) conflicts with its own WP21 dependency; WP62 caller-guarantee text cannot be an unconditional boundary.","minimal_counterexample":{"before_maternal_submit":{"child_species":"SHELLOS","child_form":0,"child_steps_to_hatch":5120,"child_gender_cache":"unfilled","child_ordinary_shiny_cache":"unfilled","pokedex_seen_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_owned_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_seen_egg_SHELLOS":false},"parent_form":0,"immediate_after":{"child_form":0,"child_is_egg":true,"gender_and_ordinary_shiny_caches":"filled by registration","pokedex_seen_SHELLOS":true,"pokedex_seen_form":"registered actual gender/shiny with form0","pokedex_owned_SHELLOS":false,"pokedex_seen_egg_SHELLOS":false},"no_submission_control":"Skip the form-inheritance call in an isolated conceptual comparison, no other registration path: form0 alone does not cause these writes. Not a normal alternate reference workflow claim."},"failure_cancel_partial_commit":{"cancel_exception_partial_commit":"This inheritance helper has no user cancellation. Form write/cache clear occur before hook/stats/registration; failures can interrupt later steps without rollback. If global player/Dex absent, registration request is skipped but setter still submits/recalculates. A full-queue receive failure occurs later in DayCare receive; any prior registration not rolled back. No actual game/host or surrogate execution performed for this proposal."},"impact":"Observable Dex record and child cache state can change during ordinary default inheritance with same shape0, before hatching or receiving. This is not only callback counting or source layout. Later clean-room no-op implementation would diverge on seen status and initial attribute/cache timing.","evidence_levels_and_execution":{"evidence_labels":["SOURCE_STATIC","DERIVED_VECTOR"],"execution":{"REFERENCE_OBSERVATION":"NOT_EXECUTED","ISOLATED_REFERENCE_EXECUTION":0,"independent_model":0,"native_game":0,"native_UI":0,"real_saves":0}}},"minimum_revision_contract":{"rule":"WP34:176 distinguish unchanged resulting form from no action: qualified maternal/Everstone assignments always use committing form rules even at same value. Link existing WP21 submission side effects and add namedSHELLOS0 egg contrast. Qualify WP62:46 caller no-egg statement to verified battle callers or explicitly record egg-generation form-submission exception, keeping no direct seen-egg/owned writes.","preserve_correct_scope":["No reference patch","No requirement for future field layout/API/class design","No guaranteed runtime/Demo/receptionist reachability or pixels","No claim same form always registers when player absent","Valid inheritance ordering/mappings/random channels unchanged","Future defect/compatibility policy remains a separate user decision"],"root_scope_o